diff --git a/docs/releases/6.1.txt b/docs/releases/6.1.txt
index 1bd4f09..563b4a2 100644
--- a/docs/releases/6.1.txt
+++ b/docs/releases/6.1.txt
@@ -382,6 +382,14 @@ Validators
 Backwards incompatible changes in 6.1
 =====================================
 
+Quoting of aliases
+------------------
+
+All database identifiers, including aliases provided to
+:meth:`~.QuerySet.annotate` and :meth:`~.QuerySet.alias`, are now quoted in
+generated SQL. Raw SQL that references such aliases, for example in
+:class:`~django.db.models.expressions.RawSQL`, may need to quote them.
+
 Database backend API
 --------------------
 
